      "@type": "PropertyValue",
      "name": "description",
      "value": "The hypothesis predicts a phase transition in capacity curve N_c(w) with a critical width w_c. Past iteration (iter 10) showed surprise=1.0 (prediction failed), indicating the current constraint family or method may not capture the topological shift. We need to explore alternative constraint constructions (low-dimensional/rigid vs. high-dimensional/fat manifolds) and verify if N_c(w) exhibits the predicted precipitous drop. This requires designing two distinct analytic constraint families, running the full width-scan training pipeline for each, and comparing N_c(w) trends against the theoretical expectation. We will not proceed to heavy computation without first validating the constraint construction and baseline behavior via lightweight symbolic/numerical checks."
